WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.482
Interrogate asks several reviewers
to test a change against its intent.

2
00:00:05.482 --> 00:00:09.920
This run uses two scripted seats
on an isolated local fixture.

3
00:00:10.933 --> 00:00:16.065
One seat flags the shouted greeting
and one flags the default greeting.

4
00:00:16.065 --> 00:00:17.799
Pi reruns both commands.

5
00:00:17.799 --> 00:00:23.653
The default greeting passes, so only the
broken shout example reaches the report.

6
00:00:37.767 --> 00:00:40.345
The report shows the input, the output,

7
00:00:40.345 --> 00:00:44.247
and why the remaining failure
breaks the intended behavior.
